One-time main/production SHA-alignment trigger: deploy the exact merged main commit after the documentation-only observation-gate updates. The existing production-deploy workflow must pass the complete test suite before deploying and verify /health git_sha equals GITHUB_SHA. Runtime source behavior, D1 schema/data, source list, circuit policy (three consecutive transient failures, 15-minute initial cooldown, exponential backoff up to six hours), Retry-After handling for HTTP 429, and AUTH_REQUIRED treatment for 401/403 remain unchanged. No migration or direct D1 data write is part of this deployment.
